{% liquid
assign form_id = 'CncInquiry-' | append: section.id
assign machine_names = 'LZ-1325 CNC Router' | split: ','
%}<div class="dd-cnc">
<section class="dd-cnc__hero"><div class="dd-cnc__wrap"><nav class="dd-cnc__crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Home</a><span>/</span><span>CNC Router Machines</span></nav><div class="dd-cnc__split"><div><p class="dd-cnc__eyebrow">SELECT BY MATERIAL &amp; FINISHED PART</p><h1>CNC Router Machines for Signs, Furniture &amp; Crafts</h1><p class="dd-cnc__lead">Plan profile cutting and decorative routing around your materials and drawings. Explore the LZ-1325, compare worktable options and confirm your application with a free sample test.</p><div class="dd-cnc__actions"><a class="dd-cnc__button" href="#CncMachine">Explore LZ-1325</a><a href="#CncContact">Get Equipment Advice →</a></div><p class="dd-cnc__note">CNC equipment manufacturing · Sample testing · Training &amp; technical support</p></div><figure>{{ images['lz-1325-standard-cutout-v1.png'] | image_url: width: 1000 | image_tag: widths: '360,700,1000', sizes: '(min-width:900px) 46vw, 100vw', loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high', alt: 'LZ-1325 CNC router with separate control cabinet' }}<figcaption>LZ-1325 CNC Router. Configuration is confirmed for your application.</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>
<section class="dd-cnc__section"><div class="dd-cnc__wrap"><h2>Start with what you want to produce</h2><div class="dd-cnc__grid"><article class="dd-cnc__panel"><h3>Signs & display panels</h3><p>Evaluate suitable acrylic and PVC boards for routed lettering, shaped signs and display components. Share the sheet specification and artwork for tooling and workholding advice.</p><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/industry-sign">Explore the Industry →</a></article><article class="dd-cnc__panel"><h3>Furniture & woodworking</h3><p>Plan board profiles, furniture components and decorative routing around your drawings, joint details and required finish.</p><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/industry-furniture">Explore the Industry →</a></article><article class="dd-cnc__panel"><h3>Crafts & decorative parts</h3><p>Review cut-out panels, assembled crafts and routed details. Small features need suitable cutters and support during machining.</p><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/industry-crafts">Explore the Industry →</a></article></div></div></section>
<section class="dd-cnc__section dd-cnc__tint" id="CncMachine"><div class="dd-cnc__wrap dd-cnc__split"><figure>{{ images['cnc-sample-decorative-panel.png'] | image_url: width: 700 | image_tag: widths: '360,700,1000', sizes: '(min-width:900px) 46vw, 100vw', loading: 'lazy', alt: 'Decorative wooden panel with CNC-routed cut-out details' }}<figcaption>Decorative routing sample. Confirm your material and design through testing.</figcaption></figure><div><p class="dd-cnc__eyebrow">FEATURED CNC ROUTER</p><h2>LZ-1325: a starting point for your workshop</h2><p>Review the spindle, table and holding method against your production needs. The right setup depends on sheet dimensions, part geometry and the machining operations required.</p><dl class="cnc-config"><div><dt>Spindle</dt><dd>3.0 kW water-cooled</dd></div><div><dt>Worktable</dt><dd>Aluminum profile + PVC</dd></div><div><dt>Control</dt><dd>Three-axis CNC control system</dd></div><div><dt>Dust extraction</dt><dd>Included in the regular configuration</dd></div><div><dt>Optional vacuum system</dt><dd>Vacuum table + vacuum pump</dd></div></dl><a class="dd-cnc__button" href="{{ routes.root_url }}products/lz-1325-cnc-router">View LZ-1325 &amp; Get a Quote</a></div></div></section>
<section class="dd-cnc__section"><div class="dd-cnc__wrap"><h2>Choose the worktable around your parts</h2><div class="dd-cnc__two"><article class="dd-cnc__panel"><h3>Standard: aluminum profile + PVC</h3><p>Plan clamps and fixtures around the toolpath. Check how each part stays supported during profile cutting, pockets and routed details.</p></article><article class="dd-cnc__panel"><h3>Optional: vacuum table + pump</h3><p>Assess board porosity, part size and layout before choosing vacuum workholding. The optional system includes both the vacuum table and vacuum pump.</p></article></div><p class="dd-cnc__note">Tooling, supplied accessories and any positioning requirements are confirmed in the equipment proposal. Printed panels need a separately confirmed alignment workflow.</p></div></section>
<section class="dd-cnc__section dd-cnc__tint"><div class="dd-cnc__wrap"><h2>See CNC equipment in customer production</h2><div class="dd-cnc__two"><article class="dd-cnc__card"><img src="{{ 'georgia-product-decorative-table.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" alt="Custom plywood storage furniture from the Georgia customer project"><div class="dd-cnc__body"><h3>Georgia · furniture components</h3><p>See factory testing, packing, shipment and the customer's woodworking applications. Finished furniture also involves assembly and finishing.</p><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/case-study-georgia">Read the Georgia Case Study →</a></div></article><article class="dd-cnc__card">{{ images['israel-event-display-installation.jpg'] | image_url: width: 700 | image_tag: widths: '360,700,1000', sizes: '(min-width:900px) 46vw, 100vw', loading: 'lazy', alt: 'Finished event display installation by our customer in Israel' }}<div class="dd-cnc__body"><h3>Israel · event display panels</h3><p>Explore shaped decoration boards and finished event displays, with CNC processing forming one part of the production workflow.</p><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/case-study-israel">Read the Israel Case Study →</a></div></article></div><p class="dd-cnc__note">Historical projects use customer-specific configurations. They do not define the current LZ-1325 standard configuration. Printing, assembly and finishing are separate production steps. <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/industry-display">Explore display production →</a></p></div></section>
{% if collection.products_count > 1 %}<section class="dd-cnc__section"><div class="dd-cnc__wrap"><h2>More CNC Router Machines</h2>{% paginate collection.products by 24 %}<div class="dd-cnc__grid">{% for machine in collection.products %}{% unless machine.handle == 'lz-1325-cnc-router' %}<article class="dd-cnc__card"><a href="{{ machine.url }}">{{ machine.featured_image | image_url: width: 700 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: machine.featured_image.alt }}<div class="dd-cnc__body"><h3>{{ machine.title | escape }}</h3><span>View Machine →</span></div></a></article>{% endunless %}{% endfor %}</div>{{ paginate | default_pagination }}{% endpaginate %}</div></section>{% endif %}
<section class="dd-cnc__section"><div class="dd-cnc__wrap dd-cnc__split"><div><h2>From sample testing to installation support</h2><p>Send material details, drawings, part dimensions and your output target. We review the machining process and sample results before recommending equipment and options.</p><p>English manuals and videos, remote installation training, equipment-specific spare parts and technical support help your team prepare for production. On-site training can be arranged. Delivery timing is agreed for each order.</p><a class="dd-cnc__button" href="#CncContact">Request a Free Sample Test</a></div><div class="dd-cnc__faq"><h2>CNC Router Selection Questions</h2><details><summary>Which materials should I discuss for CNC routing?</summary><p>Share the exact wood, plywood, MDF, acrylic or PVC board specification, thickness and required operations. Material composition, tooling and workholding must be assessed through testing before a configuration is confirmed.</p></details><details><summary>What is included in the regular LZ-1325 configuration?</summary><p>The regular configuration includes a 3.0 kW water-cooled spindle, aluminum profile + PVC worktable, three-axis CNC control system and dust extraction equipment. Your quotation confirms all supplied accessories.</p></details><details><summary>Is a vacuum table included?</summary><p>No. The vacuum system is optional and includes a vacuum table and vacuum pump. Its suitability depends on board porosity, part size and the cutting layout; assess the actual job before selecting it.</p></details><details><summary>Are customer case machines identical to the featured configuration?</summary><p>No. Customer projects can include order-specific equipment and options. The Israel and Georgia cases illustrate applications, while your quotation defines the machine and options supplied for your order.</p></details><details><summary>What should I send for a free sample test?</summary><p>Send your material specification, thickness, drawings, largest part size, required finish and output target. We will agree the test arrangements with you. Any sample shipping is agreed separately.</p></details></div></div></section>
  <section class="dd-cnc__section" id="CncContact"><div class="dd-cnc__wrap dd-cnc__split"><div><p class="dd-cnc__eyebrow">TELL US WHAT YOU WANT TO MAKE</p><h2>Get an equipment proposal for your CNC routing application</h2><p>Share your material, thickness, finished size and production requirements. We will help you plan the equipment and a free sample test.</p><p><a href="mailto:info@gzcnc-laser.com">info@gzcnc-laser.com</a><br><a href="https://wa.me/8618988946615">WhatsApp: +86 189 8894 6615</a></p><p class="dd-cnc__note">Need to share artwork or photos? Send them by email or WhatsApp. Name, email and message are required.</p></div>
    {% form 'contact', id: form_id %}
      <input type="hidden" name="contact[Source]" value="CNC router machine category">
      {% if form.posted_successfully? %}<div class="dd-cnc__success" role="status" tabindex="-1" data-cnc-success><strong>Thank you — your inquiry has been sent.</strong><p>Our team will review your requirements and contact you by email. You do not need to submit the same inquiry again.</p></div><dialog data-cnc-dialog aria-labelledby="CncSuccessTitle"><h2 id="CncSuccessTitle">Inquiry sent successfully</h2><p>Thank you for contacting Dragon Diamond. Our team will review your requirements and contact you by email.</p><button type="button" class="dd-cnc__button" data-cnc-close>Got it</button></dialog>{% endif %}
      {% if form.errors %}<div role="alert">{{ form.errors | default_errors }}</div>{% endif %}
      <div class="dd-cnc__fields"><div><label for="CncName-{{ section.id }}">Name *</label><input id="CncName-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[name]" autocomplete="name" value="{{ form.name | escape }}" required></div><div><label for="CncEmail-{{ section.id }}">Email *</label><input id="CncEmail-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[email]" type="email" autocomplete="email" value="{{ form.email | escape }}" required></div><div><label for="CncCompany-{{ section.id }}">Company</label><input id="CncCompany-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[Company]" autocomplete="organization" value="{{ form.Company | escape }}"></div><div><label for="CncWA-{{ section.id }}">WhatsApp</label><input id="CncWA-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[WhatsApp]" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" value="{{ form.WhatsApp | escape }}"></div></div>
      <label for="CncProduct-{{ section.id }}">Product Interested</label><select id="CncProduct-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[Product Interested]"><option>CNC router selection / need advice</option>{% for name in machine_names %}<option>{{ name }}</option>{% endfor %}<option>Other CNC routing requirements</option></select>
      <label for="CncMessage-{{ section.id }}">Message *</label><textarea id="CncMessage-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[body]" rows="5" placeholder="Material, thickness, finished size, production needs and destination country..." required>{{ form.body | escape }}</textarea><button type="submit" class="dd-cnc__button">Send Inquiry</button>
    {% endform %}
  </div></section></div>
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"CollectionPage","@id":{{ canonical_url | append: '#collection' | json }},"url":{{ canonical_url | json }},"name":{{ collection.title | json }},"description":{{ collection.description | strip_html | json }}}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":{{ request.origin | append: routes.root_url | json }}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":{{ collection.title | json }},"item":{{ canonical_url | json }}}]}</script>{% stylesheet %}
.dd-cnc{color:#163237;background:#fff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65}.dd-cnc *{box-sizing:border-box}.dd-cnc__wrap{max-width:1280px;margin:auto;padding:0 32px}.dd-cnc__section{padding:76px 0}.dd-cnc__tint{background:#eff5f4}.dd-cnc__hero{background:#14373b;color:#fff;padding:135px 0 64px}.dd-cnc__crumb{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:44px}.dd-cnc .dd-cnc__hero a{color:#80e0d7}.dd-cnc__split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:start}.dd-cnc__hero .dd-cnc__split{align-items:center}.dd-cnc h1,.dd-cnc h2,.dd-cnc h3{font-family:var(--font-heading--family,Arial,sans-serif);color:inherit;letter-spacing:-.025em;line-height:1.16;margin:0 0 20px}.dd-cnc h1{font-size:clamp(36px,3.4vw,54px)}.dd-cnc h2{font-size:clamp(28px,2.6vw,38px)}.dd-cnc h3{font-size:23px;margin-bottom:14px}.dd-cnc p{margin:0 0 20px}.dd-cnc__eyebrow{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;color:#087d83}.dd-cnc__hero .dd-cnc__eyebrow{color:#80e0d7}.dd-cnc__lead{font-size:19px}.dd-cnc__intro{max-width:800px}.dd-cnc__actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:28px 0}.dd-cnc a{color:#08777b;text-underline-offset:4px}.dd-cnc__button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:48px;padding:13px 20px;background:#087c80;color:#fff!important;border:0;border-radius:4px;font:700 15px/1.4 Arial,sans-serif;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:center}.dd-cnc__hero .dd-cnc__button{background:#74dfd3;color:#10383b!important}.dd-cnc figure{margin:0}.dd-cnc img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}.dd-cnc__hero img{aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:10px}.dd-cnc figcaption,.dd-cnc__note{font-size:14px;margin-top:18px!important}.dd-cnc__hero figcaption{color:#c4dcde}.dd-cnc__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:24px;margin-top:30px}.dd-cnc__two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:26px;margin-top:30px}.dd-cnc__card{border:1px solid #d6e2e2;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.dd-cnc__card img{aspect-ratio:16/10;object-fit:cover}.dd-cnc__body{padding:24px;flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.dd-cnc__body>a:last-child{margin-top:auto}.dd-cnc__body ul{padding-left:20px;margin:0 0 24px;font-size:15px}.dd-cnc__machine>a{background:#e8f0ef}.dd-cnc__machine img{object-fit:contain;padding:18px;aspect-ratio:4/3}.dd-cnc__panel{padding:26px;background:#fff;border-radius:8px;border-top:3px solid #087f82}.dd-cnc__panel p{margin:0}.dd-cnc__steps{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;border-left:2px solid #83c9c5}.dd-cnc__steps li{padding:0 0 20px 26px}.dd-cnc__steps li:last-child{padding-bottom:0}.dd-cnc__steps h3{font-size:21px}.dd-cnc__faq details{border-bottom:1px solid #b9cecc}.dd-cnc__faq summary{padding:18px 0;min-height:48px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}.dd-cnc__faq details p{padding:0 0 16px}.dd-cnc__fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 18px}.dd-cnc label{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700}.dd-cnc input,.dd-cnc textarea,.dd-cnc select{display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:48px;padding:12px;border:1px solid #a8c0c0;border-radius:4px;background:#fff;color:#163237;font:16px/1.4 Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:18px}.dd-cnc textarea{resize:vertical}.dd-cnc [id]{scroll-margin-top:125px}.dd-cnc :focus-visible{outline:3px solid #d18b24;outline-offset:4px}.dd-cnc__success{padding:20px;background:#e0f5ee;border:2px solid #087c80;margin-bottom:24px;border-radius:6px}.dd-cnc dialog{max-width:520px;width:calc(100% - 32px);padding:30px;border:0;border-radius:10px;color:#163237}.dd-cnc dialog::backdrop{background:#082429b3}.dd-cnc__two img{object-fit:contain;background:#edf3f2}.dd-cnc a{overflow-wrap:anywhere}@media(max-width:899px){.dd-cnc__wrap{padding:0 22px}.dd-cnc__split{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:32px}.dd-cnc__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.dd-cnc__section{padding:48px 0}.dd-cnc__hero{padding-top:105px}.dd-cnc__crumb{margin-bottom:28px}.dd-cnc__hero img{aspect-ratio:16/10}.dd-cnc__machine img{max-height:310px}.dd-cnc__two{grid-template-columns:1fr}.dd-cnc__body{padding:22px}.dd-cnc__actions{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.dd-cnc__fields{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.dd-cnc__compare{overflow-x:auto}.dd-cnc table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16px}.dd-cnc th,.dd-cnc td{text-align:left;vertical-align:top;border:1px solid #c3d4d4;padding:16px}.dd-cnc th{background:#edf4f3}.dd-cnc .cnc-machines{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.dd-cnc .cnc-machines img{height:330px;object-fit:contain;padding:18px;background:#edf3f3}.dd-cnc .dd-cnc__hero img{aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:contain}.dd-cnc .co2-model{font-size:28px;margin-bottom:12px}.dd-cnc .co2-need{font-weight:700;color:#087f82}.dd-cnc .co2-specs{font-size:15px}.dd-cnc .co2-additional{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}@media(max-width:700px){.dd-cnc .cnc-machines,.dd-cnc .co2-additional{grid-template-columns:1fr}.dd-cnc table{min-width:610px}.dd-cnc .cnc-machines img{height:290px}}.cnc-config{margin:22px 0}.cnc-config>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.5fr;gap:14px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #c3d4d4}.cnc-config dt{font-weight:700}.cnc-config dd{margin:0}.dd-cnc__panel>a{display:inline-block;margin-top:18px}.dd-cnc #CncMachine img{object-fit:contain;max-height:450px}.dd-cnc__two .dd-cnc__card img{height:310px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 42%}.dd-cnc .dd-cnc__hero img{object-fit:contain}@media(max-width:700px){.cnc-config>div{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:5px}.dd-cnc__two .dd-cnc__card img{height:260px}}{% endstylesheet %}
{% javascript %}
function initCncFeedback(){document.querySelectorAll('[data-cnc-dialog]').forEach(dialog=>{if(dialog.dataset.ready)return;dialog.dataset.ready='true';const status=dialog.closest('form').querySelector('[data-cnc-success]');dialog.querySelector('[data-cnc-close]').addEventListener('click',()=>dialog.close());dialog.addEventListener('close',()=>status.focus());if(typeof dialog.showModal==='function')dialog.showModal();else status.focus();});}
initCncFeedback();document.addEventListener('shopify:section:load',initCncFeedback);
{% endjavascript %}
